<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.FFI.">
	<comment location="BindgroupEntryFFI">
		<summary>
			A single binding entry in a <see cref="WebGpuSharp.Bindgroup" />.
			A BindgroupEntry can either bind a one of either a <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FFI.BufferHandle" /> with offset and size, 
			or a <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FFI.SamplerHandle" /> or <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FFI.TextureViewHandle" />.
		</summary>
	</comment>
	<group prefix="BindgroupEntryFFI.">
		<comment location="Binding">
			<summary>
				A unique identifier for a resource binding within the <see cref="WebGpuSharp.Bindgroup" />, 
				corresponding to a <see cref="WebGpuSharp.BindgroupLayoutEntry.Binding" /> and 
				a @binding attribute in the ShaderModule.
			</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Buffer">
			<summary>
				The Buffer object you want to bind.
			</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Offset">
			<summary>
				The offset, in bytes, from the beginning of the buffer to the beginning of the range exposed to the shader by the buffer binding.
			</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Size">
			<summary>
				The size, in bytes, of the buffer binding
			</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Sampler">
			<summary>
				The Sampler object you want to bind.
			</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="TextureView">
			<summary>
				The TextureView object you want to bind.
			</summary>
		</comment>
	</group>
</group>